## 2. Game Assets, Physical Production & Commercial Rights (ALL RIGHTS RESERVED)

The **Game Assets and Intellectual Property** (defined below) are **NOT** licensed under MIT and are the exclusive property of **minne100**.

**"Game Assets" include but are not limited to:**
- The visual design, illustrations, and artwork of cards (including `artifacts/` and image files).
- The specific balance, values, and narrative content contained within the card data (`cards/*.json`).
- Physical product design, board layouts, and manufacturing specifications.
- The "SuperPet" brand and associated trademarks.

**Reservation of Rights:**
- **Physical Production:** The author (minne100) reserves the **exclusive right** to manufacture, print, distribute, and sell physical versions of the cards and the game.
- **Copyright & Patents:** The author asserts full copyright over the game's creative content and reserves the right to pursue patent protection for unique mechanical designs.
- **Commercial Use:** Any commercial use of the Game Assets, including the production of physical merchandise or for-profit digital implementations of the card content, is strictly prohibited without express written consent from the author.
